WEBVTT

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:15.540
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:18.950
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:18.950 --> 00:00:22.490
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world,

00:00:22.490 --> 00:00:25.410
spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:25.410 --> 00:00:29.740
Kasel, an apprentice knight,
embarked on a journey to the King's Forest,

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:34.790
to protect his friends,
those who are dearest to him.

00:00:34.790 --> 00:00:36.990
That's why I have to go.

00:00:36.990 --> 00:00:39.450
Go...? Go where?

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:42.370
To find Clause.

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:17.910
<i></i>The Truth,

00:02:12.910 --> 00:02:17.910
<i></i>Revealed

00:02:26.790 --> 00:02:27.830
Is that...?

00:02:42.120 --> 00:02:43.540
No...

00:02:50.740 --> 00:02:52.080
Mr. Flegg...

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:14.330
Clause!

00:03:21.620 --> 00:03:23.450
This is Clause's shield...!

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:25.990
No...

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:45.040
It's... not Clause.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:49.240
Where are you going?

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:51.490
I have to find Clause!

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:52.990
Wait, Kasel!

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:56.990
Frey!

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:06.950
Demons...!

00:04:13.830 --> 00:04:15.040
Run, Frey!

00:04:15.040 --> 00:04:16.160
Kasel!

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:33.540
Bring it on!

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:46.120
Hurry!

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:54.540
Let's play, boy.

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:01.830
Kasel!

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:05.700
Is that all? But still...

00:05:05.700 --> 00:05:07.290
He does have a resemblance...

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:18.120
Frey!

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:28.950
Riheet, we'll take care of these ones.

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:30.290
Yeah.

00:05:31.290 --> 00:05:36.370
Just when I was having fun,
someone has to interfere.

00:06:05.370 --> 00:06:06.660
Incredible...

00:06:12.410 --> 00:06:13.830
Not bad.

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:17.310
This way!

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:17.990
Yeah!

00:06:19.410 --> 00:06:22.290
Let's play again, boy.

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.160
She got away...

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.410
Who was that woman?

00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:37.410
A Demon, most likely.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:39.620
Looks like you're finished with the Demons.

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:44.040
Aww, I wanted to get some action, too.

00:06:44.040 --> 00:06:46.160
Why didn't you leave some for me?

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.740
You took too long to come.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:52.410
Brother, who are they?

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:56.740
I am Kasel, a Guardian Knight of Orvelia.

00:06:56.740 --> 00:06:58.240
This is Frey.

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:02.620
Thank you very much for saving us.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:07.200
We didn't save you. We were on
a mission to put down the Demons.

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:09.040
A mission...?

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.830
We are mercenaries, hired by Orvelia.

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:13.580
By Orvelia?

00:07:13.580 --> 00:07:16.200
What are you two doing out here?

00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:19.080
You don't appear to be part
of the scouting party.

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:22.830
We came out to see if our friend was safe.

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:24.160
Huh?

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:31.290
The scouts all died.
That's why we got dragged into this.

00:07:31.290 --> 00:07:34.490
I don't believe they all died...

00:07:34.490 --> 00:07:37.490
There must be survivors.

00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:39.540
Even after seeing this?

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.330
Let's go.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:52.370
Yeah.

00:07:57.450 --> 00:07:58.620
Kasel.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:07.830
A healing spell. I can patch up small wounds.

00:08:07.830 --> 00:08:10.290
Thanks.

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:16.540
I came to help Clause, but I couldn't even
defeat a single Demon by myself.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:19.450
How can I ever protect anyone like this...?

00:08:22.410 --> 00:08:24.120
Who is it?!

00:08:24.120 --> 00:08:27.040
Whoa, we're not the enemy.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:29.490
Don't be alarmed.

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:31.990
Although I can't blame you,
given how suspicious this guy looks.

00:08:31.990 --> 00:08:33.120
Hey...

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:37.160
For starters, can you put
the pointy object away?

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:44.580
Thanks. I'm Cleo.

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:45.950
I'm a sorceress!

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:50.950
Sorceress...

00:08:50.950 --> 00:08:54.370
I'm Roi, her babysitter.

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:56.200
You mean bodyguard.

00:08:56.200 --> 00:08:57.790
Basically the same.

00:08:57.790 --> 00:08:59.290
It's completely different!

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:01.700
Um, so you two are...

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:07.990
We've come looking for you.
You're Kasel and Frey, right?

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:09.700
How did you know...?

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:12.450
Oh, great! We didn't get the wrong people!

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:16.040
I want to take you somewhere. Follow me!

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:17.540
What do you mean?

00:09:17.540 --> 00:09:19.540
You'll know if you follow me.

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.120
Let's go.

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:33.290
We're here!

00:09:33.290 --> 00:09:37.660
Here? There doesn't seem to be anything here.

00:09:37.660 --> 00:09:39.410
What's this about?

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:43.370
Come on, calm down. I'll explain.

00:09:43.370 --> 00:09:45.450
A certain person asked for our help.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:47.950
He told us that you two are
headed for the King's Forest,

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:49.950
and he wanted us to bring you here.

00:09:49.950 --> 00:09:51.990
A certain person...?

00:09:51.990 --> 00:09:53.410
It's Dominix.

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:55.740
Dominix?!

00:09:55.740 --> 00:09:58.330
You mean the sorcerer
who's in the Tower of the Sage?

00:09:58.330 --> 00:10:01.950
Yes. I've been told you know each other.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:06.700
Yes, he visited us at the orphanage
where we grew up.

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.830
But why him...?

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.620
Dominix will fill you in on the details.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.950
All right, let's get going already.

00:10:13.950 --> 00:10:16.290
Go...? Go where?

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:17.870
Isn't it obvious?

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:20.080
Up!

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:39.290
Up?

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:41.870
That's right, the Tower of the Sage.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:47.370
But how? And I thought only the chosen
get to enter the Tower of the Sage...

00:10:49.410 --> 00:10:51.950
You're looking at a chosen one.

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:53.370
Me!

00:10:57.540 --> 00:10:59.240
And now...

00:10:59.240 --> 00:11:01.080
Going up!

00:11:23.660 --> 00:11:25.660
We're here!

00:11:28.450 --> 00:11:30.160
Incredible...!

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:38.540
Hey, you two!

00:11:38.540 --> 00:11:41.200
What are you doing? Get over here.

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:53.990
Most of the people here are sorcerers
or scholars training under the Great Sage.

00:11:53.990 --> 00:11:57.580
The Great Sage... What is he like?

00:11:57.580 --> 00:11:59.870
What he's like...

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:04.160
In one word: freak.
He's supposed to be super old,

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:07.040
but he maintains his youth
using his magical powers.

00:12:07.040 --> 00:12:11.200
Choose your words wisely.
What if someone hears you?

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:14.580
I don't care, it's the truth.

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:26.660
I brought them.

00:12:31.490 --> 00:12:33.080
Mr. Dominix!

00:12:33.080 --> 00:12:36.790
I've been waiting for you, Kasel, Frey.

00:12:36.790 --> 00:12:38.410
It's been a long time.

00:12:38.410 --> 00:12:42.580
I think the last time we saw you
was when we left the orphanage.

00:12:42.580 --> 00:12:46.790
Yes. I see the two of you
are all grown up now.

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:49.580
You haven't changed at all, Mr. Dominix.

00:12:49.580 --> 00:12:54.120
Yes, really... You look exactly like
the last time we saw you.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.870
Like I said, he's a freak.

00:12:57.580 --> 00:12:59.790
He's the Great Sage.

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:05.490
We thought you were just a sorcerer
who came to visit us at the orphanage...

00:13:06.870 --> 00:13:10.950
Revealing my identity tends
to cause unwanted trouble.

00:13:10.950 --> 00:13:13.160
I see...

00:13:13.160 --> 00:13:16.290
Great Sage, why did you bring us here?

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:18.410
Just call me Dominix.

00:13:18.410 --> 00:13:20.990
There's someone I want you to see.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:36.910
Clause!

00:13:37.740 --> 00:13:41.740
He's quite heavily injured, but not fatally.

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:44.830
Give him a while, and he'll be back on his feet.

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:46.330
I'm so relieved...

00:13:46.330 --> 00:13:48.370
Yes, really...

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:52.990
We detected Demonic activities,
so Cleo and I went to help them.

00:13:52.990 --> 00:13:54.330
But...

00:13:54.330 --> 00:13:56.700
He was the only survivor.

00:13:58.290 --> 00:14:02.490
Mr. Dominix, did you know we were coming?

00:14:02.490 --> 00:14:05.240
Yes, I was watching from here.

00:14:07.620 --> 00:14:08.700
Clause!

00:14:11.660 --> 00:14:14.830
Kasel...? Frey...?

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:24.120
I see... So Gran did make it back to the castle.

00:14:24.120 --> 00:14:26.990
We were so worried about you, Clause...

00:14:26.990 --> 00:14:28.790
So you came out here, all by yourselves?

00:14:28.790 --> 00:14:30.040
Yeah.

00:14:30.040 --> 00:14:32.870
So reckless...

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:38.950
The Demons came out of nowhere
and surrounded us.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.830
We couldn't even escape.

00:14:42.120 --> 00:14:47.080
A band of mercenaries sent
from Orvelia took out the Demons.

00:14:47.080 --> 00:14:49.580
That female Demon ran off, too.

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:51.540
Female Demon?

00:14:51.540 --> 00:14:54.200
In other words, a witch, right?

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.160
So you didn't see her, Clause?

00:14:56.160 --> 00:15:00.790
No. All we fought were
the skeleton-looking Demons.

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:04.120
So... That witch...

00:15:04.120 --> 00:15:07.740
She's not related to the Demons
that attacked the scouts?

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:11.370
We don't know. Who could she be...?

00:15:13.790 --> 00:15:17.160
Now, let's let Clause rest.

00:15:17.160 --> 00:15:20.160
You two should stay here for a while.

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.160
Thank you.

00:15:21.160 --> 00:15:24.040
Thank you, Mr. Dominix.

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:27.620
Cleo, Roi, please take care of them.

00:15:27.620 --> 00:15:29.160
Oh, sure.

00:15:32.620 --> 00:15:36.990
You can use this room.
Let me know if you need anything.

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:38.620
Thank you.

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:40.490
Don't worry about it.

00:15:40.490 --> 00:15:44.740
By the way, are you sure you didn't
want to be in a room with Kasel?

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:47.910
K-Kasel and I aren't like that!

00:15:47.910 --> 00:15:52.830
Oh, really? You two looked
good for each other.

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:55.330
Please don't tease.

00:15:55.330 --> 00:15:57.160
Sorry!

00:15:57.160 --> 00:16:00.540
We're really alike. We should be friends!

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:01.540
Huh?

00:16:01.540 --> 00:16:04.540
You said you were at an orphanage, right?

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:07.950
I don't have parents, either.
Dominix found me.

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.580
I see...

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:14.830
I do enjoy life here at the Tower of the Sage.

00:16:14.830 --> 00:16:21.200
I learn all sorts of things all the time,
and train as a sorceress, too.

00:16:21.200 --> 00:16:23.370
But...

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.160
It can get a bit boring!

00:16:34.740 --> 00:16:36.450
The stars are so pretty.

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:40.830
This place is boring,
but the night sky is the best.

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:47.450
Is that...?

00:16:48.370 --> 00:16:53.330
I'll be off then. Let me know
if you need anything.

00:16:53.330 --> 00:16:54.660
Thank you.

00:17:09.120 --> 00:17:10.330
Kasel.

00:17:11.660 --> 00:17:13.700
What are you doing here?

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:15.580
Frey...

00:17:19.240 --> 00:17:22.410
If I had strength...

00:17:25.200 --> 00:17:30.290
...I could have fought those Demons together
with Clause and the others!

00:17:31.290 --> 00:17:35.490
When the Demons attacked
the village back then...

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:37.660
...my mother died protecting me.

00:17:39.540 --> 00:17:43.660
I don't ever want to lose
someone precious to me.

00:17:43.660 --> 00:17:47.160
I want to be able to protect them!

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:49.370
But...

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:50.580
Kasel...

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:56.660
I can't go on like this.

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:58.870
I have to become stronger.

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:05.490
The Black Edge have returned.

00:18:05.490 --> 00:18:07.830
We took out the Demons.

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:09.080
Here's the proof.

00:18:11.200 --> 00:18:12.830
Oh, how inauspicious!

00:18:12.830 --> 00:18:14.950
Don't bring such a thing into the castle!

00:18:14.950 --> 00:18:17.410
P-Put that away, now!

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:21.790
Now you must see what
the Black Edge are capable of.

00:18:21.790 --> 00:18:25.790
With their service, Demons are not to fear.

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:27.450
But they are...

00:18:27.450 --> 00:18:31.370
So they are dark elves, what is the issue?

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:37.120
To destroy the Demons,
all races must work together.

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:41.990
Just like King Kyle, who worked
with allies like the elves and orcs

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:44.040
to defeat the Dark Lord 100 years ago.

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:48.910
We thank you for your efforts.

00:18:48.910 --> 00:18:53.490
Get rid of that Demon head.
It must not be seen by the populace.

00:18:54.540 --> 00:18:55.700
I understand.

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:04.660
Did you see the looks on their faces?

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:09.290
Just showing them the Demon head
almost made them collapse in fear.

00:19:12.580 --> 00:19:16.830
Orvelia is lead by cowards like them.

00:19:16.830 --> 00:19:22.160
Behl, the Chancellor, might be diligent,
but he is incapable of any action!

00:19:23.290 --> 00:19:28.330
I, El Moriham, descend from
a long line of Orvelian Chancellors.

00:19:28.330 --> 00:19:33.330
Me ascending to the rank of
Chancellor is a family wish as well.

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:36.830
We will silence those fools
and make them do our bidding,

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:40.080
but for that to happen,
you must deliver results.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:42.700
Yes, I understand.

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:46.540
It was truly fortuitous that
you and I met, Riheet...

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:51.040
If my wish comes true,
you all will live a good life.

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:54.830
It wouldn't be out of the question
for you to become a noble.

00:19:57.120 --> 00:19:58.870
To our future.

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:07.740
Clause, how are you doing?

00:20:07.740 --> 00:20:09.490
I'm fine.

00:20:09.490 --> 00:20:11.870
We have to go back to Orvelia
as soon as possible.

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:14.740
Don't push yourself too hard.

00:20:14.740 --> 00:20:18.040
Maybe you should rest a bit more.

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:21.080
Who knows when the Demons might strike again?

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:22.580
I can't relax now.

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:23.830
But...

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:28.790
I survived so that I can defeat the Demons.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:34.120
For the friends who've died,
I will use my life for Orvelia.

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:35.990
Clause...

00:20:35.990 --> 00:20:37.790
Kasel, Frey.

00:20:38.740 --> 00:20:42.990
Dominix wants to see you.
He says it's important.

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:50.910
They're here.

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:54.830
Thank you. You're dismissed, Cleo.

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:56.990
Sure.

00:20:56.990 --> 00:21:01.540
So what's the important issue?

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:04.080
There is something I need to tell you.

00:21:05.120 --> 00:21:08.120
Frey, you should hear this, too.

00:21:08.120 --> 00:21:09.490
Yes...

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:13.250
Hey.

00:21:13.250 --> 00:21:14.870
Shh!

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:19.790
Your mother--Arlette--had she
ever told you about your father?

00:21:19.790 --> 00:21:20.790
No.

00:21:20.790 --> 00:21:27.160
I asked her not to tell you
anything until the right time.

00:21:27.160 --> 00:21:28.790
What do you mean?

00:21:30.450 --> 00:21:36.740
You are the son of King Kyle,
who fought Dark Lord Angmund 100 years ago.

00:21:38.540 --> 00:21:42.830
You must be able to inherit
the Holy Sword Aea, I'm certain.

00:21:42.830 --> 00:21:46.330
How can I be the son of King Kyle?

00:21:46.330 --> 00:21:50.660
Are you trying to trick me?
King Kyle lived 100 years ago.

00:21:50.660 --> 00:21:55.040
My mother died when I was young,
when she was attacked by Demons!

00:21:55.040 --> 00:21:56.700
Why are you making up such lies?!

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:02.540
I will explain everything.

00:22:02.540 --> 00:22:06.620
The things that happened
when King Kyle was alive...

00:23:47.200 --> 00:23:49.620
Mr. Dominix tells us about the past.

00:23:49.620 --> 00:23:51.660
How King Kyle defeated the Dark Lord.

00:23:51.660 --> 00:23:55.370
The Holy Sword, Aea, that King Kyle had...

00:23:56.490 --> 00:24:00.830
Knowing the truth, Kasel makes a choice.

00:23:58.040 --> 00:24:00.870
<i></i>What the

00:23:58.040 --> 00:24:00.870
<i></i>Predecessors

00:23:58.040 --> 00:24:00.870
<i></i>Left Behind
